#. event 0, page 0 | screen 817, cell (12,6)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e000/p0/t00"
msgid "花子　：どもー、花子です。"
msgstr "Hanako: Hiya, Hanako here."

#. event 0, page 0 | screen 817, cell (12,6)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e000/p0/t01"
msgid "花子　：今回、陰陽道については触れてない　　　　けど間接的に取り入れている所は　　　　　あるよ！　コドクとかね。"
msgstr "Hanako: This time we don't go into Onmyodo, but parts of it are worked in indirectly! Like kodoku."

#. event 0, page 0 | screen 817, cell (12,6)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e000/p0/t02"
msgid "花子　：陰陽寮とか出てくると異常に複雑に　　　　なるし、風水学も関係するから、　　　　　ちょっとしたサワリを使ってるよ！"
msgstr "Hanako: Bring in the Bureau of Onmyo and it gets insanely complicated, and feng shui is involved too, so we only use a little taste of it!"

#. event 1, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e001/p1/t00"
msgid "花子　：呼んだぁ？　花子！"
msgstr "Hanako: You called? Hanako!"

#. event 1, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e001/p1/t01"
msgid "花子　：霊峰とかで”口寄せ”の人とか　　　　　　いるでしょ？　先祖の霊とか呼んで　　　　代わりに喋ったりする人！"
msgstr "Hanako: You know the \"kuchiyose\" mediums at sacred mountains? The people who call up your ancestors' spirits and speak in their place!"

#. event 1, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e001/p1/t02"
msgid "花子　：あんなの大ウソ・・・いやいや、　　　　　信用できない人、多いハズ！"
msgstr "Hanako: That's all a big li... no, no, I mean, plenty of them can't be trusted!"

#. event 1, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e001/p1/t03"
msgid "花子　：実際はね・・・霊を呼んだ途端、　　　　　別の低級な霊とかがねぇ・・・ふぅ"
msgstr "Hanako: What really happens is... the moment they call a spirit, some other low-grade spirit goes and... sigh."

#. event 1, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e001/p1/t04"
msgid "花子　：あんまり露骨に書くと苦情とか　　　　　　来そうだからやめとく・・・。"
msgstr "Hanako: If I write it too bluntly we'll get complaints, so I'll stop there..."

