#. event 93, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e093/p1/t01"
msgid "花子　：このゲームでホラーもの、という　　　　　より”幽霊”そのものに興味を持つ　　　　人がいると思うけど・・・"
msgstr "Hanako: I think this game will get some people interested not so much in horror as in \"ghosts\" themselves, but..."

#. event 93, page 1 | screen 128, cell (2,2)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT14/e093/p1/t02"
msgid "花子　：中途半端な興味は危険！　ホント！　　　　こんなゲーム作っておきながら　　　　　　悪いんだけど・・・"
msgstr "Hanako: A half-hearted interest is dangerous! Really! Sorry to say so after making a game like this, but..."

